# SDM845 shared kernel configuration.
#
# Empty of options on purpose: the SDM845 support this board needs is the
# generic ARM64 device-tree platform plus the ARM architectural timer, and both
# come from profiles/arch/arm64/configs/common.config.  The file exists because
# soc-support.md step 3 lists configs/<soc>.config in the required layout, and
# because board.toml's [kernel] config_fragments names it.
#
# What is NOT here, and why:
#   CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_UFS       the storage path is still unbuilt for this SoC;
#                               the board disables it until VerifiedRoot works.
#   CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_ADRENO    components.toml has no Adreno 630 at all.
#   CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_LEGACY_DISPLAY
#                               the panel is a board input (Samsung sofef00 on
#                               dual DSI) and depends on TLMM pins.
